the strong form). KILL: a certified obstruction - the
evaluated excess is a positive form outside the cone,
certified at a named seat, i.e. `not GDGlobal5` proved.
PARTIAL: the evaluation lands but cone membership
depends on named per-representation data (Gram/CG data
