   irreducible rho (`2 <= d`), if every single doubled
   moment `doubledQuadReMoment C P` (primitive `C`,
   `P in C`) lies in GD-0's cone - the Prop named
   `DoubledMomentInCone5` - then `GDGlobal5` holds.
   So the whole order-5 cone question is exactly the
