  the projector onto the (2,1) invariant subspace:
  relative to a chosen invariant basis `e` it is the
  Gram sum with coefficients from `(gramMat e)^{-1}`
  (`triTwirl21_eq_gram_sum`), and the basis dimension
  is `a(rho) = triDim21 rho` - a Clebsch-Gordan number
