  `GDGlobal5` is registered in GD-0's general Haar
  context. Even strands (i)-(ii) settled at finite
  seats would leave the registered Prop's general
  context unreached by the owned evaluation.

Per the pack's PARTIAL clause this is the landing:
the evaluation is in (item 1), the cone question is
reduced to its exact per-representation content
(item 3), the dependence is named (strands (i)-(iii)),
